To nbody n as whole number.
    If n is at most 0.
        Give back 1 as whole number.
    Changeable na1 is n minus 1.
    Changeable na2 is n minus 2.
    Changeable nb is nbody na1.
    Changeable nc is nbody na2.
    Changeable s1 is nb plus nc.
    Changeable s2 is s1 plus n.
    Give back s2 as whole number.
Say nbody 40.
